node_modules/
dist/
test/fixtures/generated/
website/src/generated/
.DS_Store
test/crossvalidate/generated/

# What `npm pack` leaves in the root. Commits here are made with `git add -A`, and the guard
# that catches a stray top-level entry catches it by failing the suite — which is also what
# `prepublishOnly` runs, so a forgotten tarball would block the next release rather than just
# sit there. One line is cheaper than that.
*.tgz

# Anything removed from the tree is preserved here rather than destroyed.
deleted/

# Editor and agent scratch for this checkout: launch configuration, working notes. It has never
# been part of a release, and until now that was arranged by excluding it from the commit by
# hand. Ignoring it is where that belongs, and it keeps `git status` honest about what is
# actually untracked.
.claude/
